#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Summary: {found} field(s) found with a verified quote, {unknown} unknown (not stated "
"or not extracted), {unverified} withheld because the quote did not verify."
msgstr ""
"Resumen: {found} campo(s) encontrado(s) con una cita verificada, {unknown} "
"desconocido(s) (no indicado(s) o no extraído(s)), {unverified} retenido(s) porque la "
"cita no se verificó."

msgid "Technical reference"
msgstr "Referencia técnica"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This command sends document text from the package to the configured model provider "
"({provider}, model {model}). The provider's processing terms apply to that text. "
"Nothing is written to a log. The default `check` command does not do this."
msgstr ""
"Este comando envía el texto del documento del paquete al proveedor de modelo "
"configurado ({provider}, modelo {model}). Los términos de procesamiento del proveedor"
" se aplican a ese texto. Nada se escribe en un registro. El comando `check` "
"predeterminado no hace esto."

